ef="/encyclopedia/adandozan">Adandozan</a> and revives royal power</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1851</span><span class="rf-text">A Dahomean assault on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abeokuta">Abeokuta</a> is repulsed with heavy losses</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1892</span><span class="rf-text">French troops under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alfred-amedee-dodds">Colonel Dodds</a> take <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abomey">Abomey</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1894</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/behanzin">Behanzin</a> surrenders and is exiled to Martinique</span></li></ol>
